fields.value:
{{Breaknotes
| name = Poison Sting
| desc = [[Break]] sources on Venomancer disables this {{M|innate}} ability on the {{U|Plague Ward}}.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Poison Sting
| desc = Both the {{U|Plague Ward}}'s and the {{U|Serpent Ward}}'s attacks can apply {{A|Venomancer|Poison Sting}} when drafted.
}}

 * The ability has two components with the following debuff priorities:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|venomancer_poison_sting}} {{to}} [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|venomancer_poison_sting_ward}}
*** Both applied debuffs have the following properties:
**** Applies the debuff upon a successful attack.
**** Deals {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in 1-second intervals, starting 1 second upon debuff application.
**** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration and updates its ability values.
**** {{Symbol|Modifier|Flag}}
***** Has the {{M|HP Removal}} flag.
***** Does not proc {{M|on-damage effects}}.
*** {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||health regeneration reduction|10tal}} {{M|talent|t=t1l}} does not update the current applied debuffs.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|venomancer_poison_sting_ward}}
*** The {{A|Venomancer|Plague Ward}}'s attack applies an independent Poison Sting debuff instance of its corresponding level.
**** When affected by both debuffs, Venomancer's Poison Sting take precedence, while the unit's debuff does nothing.
**** The damage instance applied is sourced to Venomancer.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Magical}} {{M|spell damage}} per second: {{Code|({{#var:Poison Sting value1}} + ({{#var:Poison Sting basic1}} × SelfLvl)) × f([[#Plague Ward|Ward]])}} 
** Ability duration: {{Code|{{#var:Poison Sting value3}} + ({{#var:Poison Sting basic2}} × SelfLvl)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Poison Sting icon0}}
| desc = Venomancer's attacks slow enemies and deal damage over time.
}}

