 * Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|venomancer_snakebite}} on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
** Does not utilize {{M|projectiles}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|venomancer_snakebite}}
*#* {{Symbol|Dot|On}} {{Symbol|Dot|Off}} ... {{Symbol|Dot|Off}} {{Symbol|Dot|Off}}
*#** Applies the first {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*#* {{Symbol|Dot|Off}} {{Symbol|Dot|On}} ... {{Symbol|Dot|On}} {{Symbol|Dot|On}}
*#** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Snakebite basic1}}|v1={{#var:Snakebite value2}}}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in {{#var:Snakebite basic1}}-second intervals, starting {{#var:Snakebite basic1}} seconds upon debuff application, over {{#expr:{{#var:Snakebite value3}}/{{#var:Snakebite basic1}}}} damage intervals.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
*#* Reapplies the first {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} on the debuff-affected enemy per successful attack that the debuff-affected enemy applied.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Snakebite icon0}}
| desc = Venomancer summons a Spawn of Aktok to sink its fangs into a target, dealing magic damage and applying a toxin that does damage every second. When the target attacks while infected, they take the initial damage again.
}}
* Deals a min {{calc|v1+v2*{{#var:Snakebite value3}}|v1={{#var:Snakebite value1}}|v2={{#var:Snakebite value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1+v2*{{#var:Snakebite value3}}|v1={{#var:Snakebite value1 tal}}|v2={{#var:Snakebite value2}}}}|20tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) over the entire debuff duration, without reapplying the first spell damage component.

